                                "sense_id": "cf4a0291-b7ec-34dd-a700-2e7d381d9fc9",
                                "text": "“Mimi, here’s the thing. When somebody in that crowd goes and does something majorly out of control like that, it’s only a matter of days before the rest of the girls in school make sure they've caught up. …”"
